(ABSTRACT:) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(This study provides the first comprehensive modern morphological) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(analysis of Standard Tangkhul Naga by a native linguist. Focusing on) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(word-formation strategies, the dissertation examines the typology of) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(roots, derivational prefixes, inflections, and compound formations. We) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(investigate nominal compounding \(endocentric and exocentric\),) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(reduplication, verbal valency alterations, and postpositional case) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(affixation, demonstrating how Tangkhul balances agglutinating morphology) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(with analytic syntax.) Tj
