0 -16 Td
/F1 8 Tf
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Tangkhul verbal roots undergo valence modification through prefixation) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(and auxiliary compounding. Reflexives take prefix nge- \(ngathang 'wash) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(oneself'\), reciprocals take nge- with root reduplication \(ngazek-ngazek) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
('converse mutually'\), and causatives take suffix -sak. Completive aspect) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(is marked by -ser, durative by -kapam, and future intentional by -ra.) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F2 10 Tf
